# Always deploy

When finishing a feature, fix, or other code change the user asked for:

1. Verify the build (and relevant tests when practical).
2. Commit the relevant changes with a concise message.
3. Push to `main` / the tracked remote branch to trigger Vercel.
4. Confirm the production deploy is Ready (Vercel status and/or https://1-tim4.vercel.app).
5. Report the commit SHA and deploy result briefly.

Do this by default unless the user explicitly says not to deploy or to keep changes local-only.
Do not force-push or skip hooks unless the user explicitly requests it.
